{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:10 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲與長孫合力「救火」  網民錯重點熱議獨立屋超靚環境  四度離婚拒再娶兒孫滿堂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b642c6d7e4b61c78fa7db68ca772dc1e/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_102.png\"/>\n<p>現年73歲、被譽為「香港搖滾之父」的夏韶聲（Danny Summer），日前在社交平台分享生活短片，分享與孫仔玩樂日常。他先是上載一段在綠草如茵的大花園打理庭院的影片，幽默寫道：「在香港似乎沒有一日是停工、在這裏要搵啲嘢做……」，透露近日回到香港。隨後再釋出「下集…我大孫仔受訓」的短片；片中他手持水喉一邊大喊「Are you ready?」，一邊帶領長孫進行模擬消防演習，搞笑模仿自己當年參演經典TVB劇集《烈火雄心》中飾演消防員的救火場面。然而，比起他與長孫逗趣的互動，網民的目光全被背景中開揚清幽的獨立屋及寬敞大花園吸引，紛紛留言：「環境好靚」，意外令其愜意優質的居住環境成為熱話。</p>\n<h2>夏韶聲經歷四度離婚拒再娶</h2>\n<p>螢幕前形象不羈的夏韶聲，現實中的感情生活同樣極具戲劇性，多年來經歷過四段婚姻卻皆以離婚告終。他早在19歲時奉女成婚迎娶首任妻子，其後先後經歷與美國妻子及智利妻子BiBi的婚姻，被傳因前TVB藝員梁詠琳介入而離婚。直至2005年他與越南前首富千金Tina閃婚進駐美國豪宅；可惜婚姻維持約九年後破裂，他更因婚前協議「淨身出戶」返港住西貢村屋。歷盡情場起伏的他曾坦言「風流但不下流」，雖然近年與年齡相差逾三十載的圈外女友感情穩定，但他早已堅定表明「四次婚姻已經夠晒數」，瀟灑表態絕不再步入婚姻殿堂。</p>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲有位細36歲的女友，二人拍拖16年，好幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ca468401b53160d93b8d8748444e62e/2024-01/DS1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲有兩個女兒及三名外孫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f7844cacb6eb53cd5570d2705ab4bc84/2024-07/_2021111412050885489.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲兩個外孫好唱得。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca4e28541515484478014a3c200d57e6/2023-03/DANNY_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲兩個外孫仔女都識玩樂器。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d26073a1036855b08d2db17ad90424a8/2023-03/DANNY_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲外孫好可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f71ec96f15eb27eefe1182145c3d87a/2023-03/DANNY_09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲三代同堂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65b9c02875684b087f7f77e85edbc967/2023-03/DANNY_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲在綠草如茵的大花園打理庭院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02eb6178cf8d449a7156b2eb3c5fd288/2026-10/3_6_15.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲洗枱扮救火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/514566585b1b572928557aa68f97f0c2/2026-10/4_7_15.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲仍然有「戲癮」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76929489b3654d008466518c5f95e476/2026-10/5_4_12.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲叫孫仔一齊玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/176bcc5009279d6a9cd3d6003b71fdc9/2026-10/6_4_23.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲手持水喉一邊大喊「Are you ready?」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b79f5463da91c9d0e00ecb419fb2f6d9/2026-10/7_3_7.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲帶領長孫進行模擬消防演習，搞笑模仿自己當年參演經典TVB劇集《烈火雄心》中飾演消防員的救火場面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56d36b2951fed9c54fda7ca827b36257/2026-10/8_5_20.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"然而，比起他與長孫逗趣的互動，網民的目光全被背景中開揚清幽的獨立屋及寬敞大花園吸引。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b3eec60d02cb021755dd97423eccb33/2026-10/9_5_4.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲外孫個個都好有音樂天份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f7ff3e9ebee0acf25dd7d074fa20aeb/2023-03/DANNY_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲曾帶外孫仔Kyle亮相ViuTV節目《甜爺爺》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4de04226eb59f3e020ca51ca80b803bf/2024-07/_2021091721522563172.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲的外孫仔Kyle越大越靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e718856756ed4698f00a341e7468194/2023-03/DANNY_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲拍片表示「有感而發」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2802deee3db4e4e6cc467c4a2a60dc9e/2024-07/d650144d-1d48-4624-a681-b1a99a274378.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲曾出席外孫仔的幼稚園畢業禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c7edbf0e45acd4be6c14982594b9660/2024-07/CAP9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲的外孫仔小時候好可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c814346ccb5816b81c0607fa201db88/2024-07/CAP8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲又晒外孫仔小時候的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fd4ee7c5341c0309273b53759d2fa03/2024-07/CAP7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲表示為免外孫仔受到影響，一直以來都未曾提過有關學校的話題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c937dc9dd0369d631569eb5fd1675a8a/2024-07/CAP3_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲外孫仔影畢業相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/737df4183304ca8895b7345da036fd09/2024-07/CAP4_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲坐在台下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f91886202901138fe86cbaa90ce35a0/2024-07/CAP5_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲表示外孫仔會與好友一同升中學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39bf2bef805d4be012dab96137f8402e/2024-07/CAP12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲與外孫仔在學校拍攝不少照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e7f91d07fa71c7a33653214d44f408e/2024-07/CAP13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲又感謝老師。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d73ed912bc68793416db749710bdba97/2024-07/CAP14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲的外孫仔Kyle暑假後便是中學生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92be467acaf95f76d82f29df798712ff/2024-07/DANNY_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲兩爺孫合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ece5d0ce3b772ebe2c6f3d60826d820d/2024-07/DANNY_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲拍片慶祝外孫仔小學畢業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/334a275f05a048e60f9c957a2419183a/2024-07/CAP1_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲表示外孫仔讀六年小學，他是首次踏足其學校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1e30f6b3d4d2c2dec464a49b54464c9/2024-07/CAP2_3.jpg\"/>\n<h2>夏韶聲兒孫滿堂享天倫之樂</h2>\n<p>雖然感情上堅持自由單身，但私底下的夏韶聲卻是一位極具親和力的慈祥好爺爺。他與首任妻子育有兩名女兒，如今女兒們更為他開枝散葉誕下多名孫仔孫女，令他兒孫滿堂、盡享三代同堂之福。夏韶聲向來對孫輩寵愛有加，除了曾帶外孫Kyle亮相ViuTV真人騷《甜爺爺》大展默契互動，平日更在網上開設《孫仔萬歲》系列紀錄溫馨日常，更預備將印有自己名字的珍藏結他傳承給孫兒；如今在香港又與大孫仔打成一片、弄孫為樂，退而不休的悠閒生活讓不少網民大感羨慕。</p>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲與陳小春在1998年TVB劇集《鹿鼎記》中分飾「陳近南」和「韋小寶」兩師徒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67d49f3349ac354fbbfcbb116d47bcec/2025-05/04_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"時至今日陳小春仍稱呼夏韶聲「師父」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6064a9124ac1994ab1d301a4162edb5/2025-05/05_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有「香港搖滾之父」之稱的夏韶聲曾推不少經典金曲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a2dd589506b6b8b134843ddf3db03e0/2023-03/DANNY_000.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲經典歌曲《空凳》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7f492d5f85319faa5a989a54fde38ea/2023-03/DANNY_00.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲經典歌曲《永不放棄》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c59ed4ec7adfb54914669fc5ea86dfdc/2023-03/DANNY_00a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲經典歌曲《交叉點》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e3b78877e47e4feef12b562486eb92b/2023-03/DANNY_00b.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲曾演出TVB劇《美味天王》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d049e3d94916a0f860a92c05f3601fc5/2023-03/DANNY_00c.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲曾演出TVB劇《烈火雄心》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d0379902a8be08275a9692ffaeea8d0/2023-03/DANNY_00d.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲曾演出TVB劇《烈火雄心》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16c43de18bf18ca7506bb81d7cde5e75/2023-03/DANNY_00e.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲是UFO發燒友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21a7a6087761a769b6fa76cde8f19c23/2023-03/DANNY_00g.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲不時上節目大談在不同地方遇見UFO的經歷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b46daff52c1ce29641422c9717ed242b/2023-03/DANNY_00h.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲曾接受陳志雲YouTube頻道訪問，被問及如何維繫良好伴侶關係，他笑言：「我諗我應該都有資格講。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6950d077efcfea5bd20a9690860e72e/2025-07/VS--YouTube-8DannySummer-67_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲首爆有段婚姻無簽紙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61422a273ea4dae5245da65a13f6f30c/2025-07/VS--YouTube-8DannySummer-68_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲反駁被指花心，但承認曾因定力不夠而出軌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bfa16c70eb3e2335c90b66ce31735604/2025-07/VS--YouTube-8DannySummer-69_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲曾擁有不少逼真的模型槍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cea4d22ac19da210737f7e382e022042/2023-03/DANNY_05.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"夏韶聲第四任太太為越南華僑Tina。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb9e61c1906aec4e46d411a76ee8ead1/2024-01/enp14p11041204.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"可惜同樣離婚收場。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5044010e89944c5dc54eb902cf9ca1d4/2024-01/DS2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"美國成長的梁詠琳是第一代《閃電傳真機》主持之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55626197fcfb204d6473d1490ce5451d/2023-04/VideoScreenshot--YouTube--1%E2%80%9900%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琳參加第七屆新秀歌唱大賽入行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/229b1893d42c1e2afca6d6535b54c2a6/2023-04/VideoScreenshot---myTVSUPER-55%E2%80%9909%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琳沒有得名，及後入行並在TVB發展多年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d9efda1bc3c5699e72967fad2db5c1f/2023-04/VideoScreenshot---myTVSUPER-57%E2%80%9928%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琳演出《刑事偵緝檔案》結識有婦之夫夏韶聲，二人發展不倫戀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5003aa7bf4881d3801aa12d0d337c302/2023-04/enp21p06091201_0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T13:19:46.437451+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":808,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T16:37:40.190557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T13:17:37.710896+00:00","content_hash":"e3afc48f3c7010629c25f5c3edac958fe96bc5e9aa262cad4c0c8fe266a27027","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}